OL,3,GNEWSA'Speed dating for trucks' saves
OL,4,Amoney for food charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe food distribution charity Felix
OL,7,Fspent #5.6m last year collecting
OL,8,Fsurplus produce, and getting it to the
OL,9,Fcommunity organisations it supports.
OL,11,FRichard Smith, director of food
OL,12,Finnovation at Felix, said: "These are
OL,13,Fcosts we cannot cut. Without our
OL,14,Flogistics, this food would never reach
OL,15,Fthe millions who need it most."
OL,17,FBut a new platform dubbed "speed dating
OL,18,Ffor trucks" has been launched to reduce
OL,19,Fthose costs.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
