OL,3,GNEWSA'Speed dating for trucks' saves
OL,4,Amoney for food charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FUsing AI technology to bring together
OL,7,Flogistics providers, retailers and
OL,8,Fmanufacturers, it matches spare haulage
OL,9,Fcapacity with surplus food collections.
